        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Ranger Rick, TENNIS, Wild Animal Baby, Your Big Backyard\n- Organizations: National Wildlife Federation, Sinclair Broadcast Group\n- Topics: Children's magazines, Sports magazines\n\nFacts:\n- Ranger Rick, originally called Ranger Rick's Nature Magazine, is a children's nature magazine.\n- Ranger Rick is published by the United States National Wildlife Federation.\n- TENNIS is an American sports magazine.\n- TENNIS is owned by the Sinclair Broadcast Group.\n- The National Wildlife Federation also publishes Your Big Backyard.\n- Your Big Backyard and Ranger Rick are geared toward older children.\n- Wild Animal Baby is related to the National Wildlife Federation's children's magazine lineup.",
